<title>MALAYSIA: Public Packages, Jaya Netting suspended.</title>
<headline>Public Packages, Jaya Netting suspended.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Paper manufacturer Public Packages Holdings Bhd and fish nets maker Jaya Netting Industries Bhd, both suspended their stocks on Monday morning pending release of their half-year results, company officials said.</p>
<p>Both companies said the results would be published by Monday afternoon.</p>
<p>Public Packages and Jaya Netting are both listed on the Second Board of the Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-230 8911)</p>
